---
component: gauge
# The gauge always shows where the last dive's needle stuck; a host that
# means some other depth can still pass `fathoms=`.
params:
  fathoms: { type: int, default: "@lastFathoms" }
  mood: { enum: [calm, grim] }
---

## Gauge

::sfx{sound="brass needle ticking"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: The depth gauge on the rail still shows {{@fathoms}} fathoms, where the needle stuck.

<match subject="@mood">
  <when is="grim">
    @sefa{code="0010" emotion="sad"}: I'll mark it on the chart. Another line that ends in a cross.
  </when>
  <when is="calm">
    @sefa{code="0020" emotion="content"}: I'll mark it on the chart. Deeper than yesterday.
  </when>
</match>
